What is Transition Finance (Decarbonization Lending)?
Transition Finance (Decarbonization Lending) encompasses financial products such as loans and credit enhancements designed to help carbon-intensive sectors transition to low-carbon and sustainable operations. These instruments support investments in emissions-reducing technologies, process optimizations, renewable energy integration, energy efficiency upgrades, and broader business model transformations in industries including steel, cement, power generation, and heavy manufacturing.
